{
  "id": "ca-problem-south-coast-air",
  "type": "problem",
  "name": "Ozon og PM2.5 i South Coast Air Basin",
  "rank": 1,
  "summary": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "EPA fører Los Angeles-South Coast Air Basin som Serious nonattainment for PM2.5-standarden fra 2012, med 2010-befolkning 15 716 242 i fire fylker og årsdesignverdi 13,2 for 2023-2025.",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "note": "",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://www3.epa.gov/airquality/greenbook/rncl2.html",
          "title": "PM-2.5 nonattainment areas, Green Book, data current as of September 30, 2026",
          "publisher": "US EPA",
          "retrieved": "2026-10-28",
          "archive_url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20260516043021/https://www3.epa.gov/airquality/greenbook/rncl2.html",
          "archive_note": "Wayback availability 2026-10-28 fant et øyeblikksbilde."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "South Coast AQMD skriver at bassenget er i extreme nonattainment for 8-timers ozonstandarden fra 2015, og at 2022-planen legger opp til å nå standarden i 2037.",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "note": "",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.aqmd.gov/docs/default-source/default-document-library/sc-contingency-measures-finalcb7e02f0c2b66f27bf6fff02004a91a9.pdf",
          "title": "South Coast Air Basin Contingency Measure SIP Revision for the 2015 8-Hour Ozone NAAQS",
          "publisher": "South Coast AQMD",
          "retrieved": "2026-10-28",
          "archive_url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20251111112546/https://www.aqmd.gov/docs/default-source/default-document-library/sc-contingency-measures-finalcb7e02f0c2b66f27bf6fff02004a91a9.pdf",
          "archive_note": "Wayback availability 2026-10-28 fant et øyeblikksbilde."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "I 2018-regnskapet som AQMD bruker i 2025-dokumentet, sto vegtrafikk for 44 prosent av NOx, tunge lastebiler for 27 prosent av all NOx, og stasjonære kilder for 15 prosent.",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "note": "",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.aqmd.gov/docs/default-source/default-document-library/sc-contingency-measures-finalcb7e02f0c2b66f27bf6fff02004a91a9.pdf",
          "title": "South Coast Air Basin Contingency Measure SIP Revision for the 2015 8-Hour Ozone NAAQS",
          "publisher": "South Coast AQMD",
          "retrieved": "2026-10-28",
          "archive_url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20251111112546/https://www.aqmd.gov/docs/default-source/default-document-library/sc-contingency-measures-finalcb7e02f0c2b66f27bf6fff02004a91a9.pdf",
          "archive_note": "Wayback availability 2026-10-28 fant et øyeblikksbilde."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "Census tract 6037204920 i Los Angeles County har CalEnviroScreen 4.0-score 82,39 og persentil 99,97, med ACS 2015-2019-befolkning 2 751. Det er ett høyt belastet område, ikke hele bassenget.",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "note": "",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://services1.arcgis.com/PCHfdHz4GlDNAhBb/arcgis/rest/services/CalEnviroScreen_4_0_Results_/FeatureServer/0/query?where=tract%3D6019001100&outFields=tract,CIscore,CIscoreP,ACS2019TotalPop,pm,drink,pest&returnGeometry=true&outSR=4326&f=geojson",
